  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-13T04:08:47.142306Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-13T04:29:05.302015Z",
  "totalBlocks": 146,
  "translatedBlocks": 72,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc180df27a24eddd",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI 奋力一搏，推出了价格比 GPT-5.6 低 50% 的 GPT-6 Sol 和 Luna，但发布消息的浏览量已达 17M 且仍在增长，今天注定属于 Claude Opus 5.5——“我们全新 Claude 5.5 系列中的首个模型”，它“在大多数任务上的表现与 Claude Fable 5.1 相当，运行成本则比 Opus 5 低 40%”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c2b49bbaae07223",
      "translationZh": "Opus 5.5 在大多数基准测试中击败 Fable，或与 Astra 一较高下，两家实验室都将 API 降价归功于效率优化工作，而从预填充到解码，再到整体计算，各方面都有巨大的两位数提升……",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5e856b15b39c8fd",
      "translationZh": "……但在某些前沿任务中，词元使用效率低下抵消了部分提升。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5ef747e4725c796",
      "translationZh": "不过，Claude 此次发布中一个罕见的重点是写作能力的改进：“它会将最重要的信息放在最前面，并遵循你给出的写作规则，让长时间的会话更容易理解和跟进。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e5a0b09a109c90d",
      "translationZh": "我们可以证实这一点——这里是今天分别用 Opus 5.5 和 Sol 6 生成的 AINews 栏目。差别简直是天壤之别——我们将立即把今后的 AINews 迁移到 Opus 5.5，直到我们迎来 AINews 的下一个模型/版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb46c86d80878f6f",
      "translationZh": "他们还发布了关于大型多智能体集群（以及效率）的初步研究：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84a6eabe397cc01f",
      "translationZh": "9/21/2026-9/22/2026 的 AI 新闻。我们查看了 12 个 subreddit、544 个 Twitter 账号，没有再查看其他 Discord。AINews 网站支持搜索所有往期内容。提醒一下，AINews 现在是 Latent Space 的一个栏目。你可以选择订阅或取消订阅不同频率的电子邮件！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4963ddb8402f1673",
      "translationZh": "头条：Claude Opus 5.5 发布、数据与各方反应",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "95688530dbfbb589",
      "translationZh": "Anthropic 推出了 Claude Opus 5.5，这是全新 Claude 5.5 系列的首个模型。其卖点是以 Opus 的定价提供 Fable 5.1 级别的能力，同时速度更快、写作更出色。大约一小时后，OpenAI 发布了 GPT‑6 Sol 和 Luna。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0de5e8acfab226e",
      "translationZh": "发布时的宣称。Opus 5.5“在大多数任务上的表现达到 Claude Fable 5.1 的水平，运行成本比 Opus 5 低 40%”（@claudeai；@AnthropicAI）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18d88d332e7d8975",
      "translationZh": "领先领域。Anthropic 表示，它在智能体编程、计算机操作和知识工作方面处于领先地位（@claudeai）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d93e0e6764629442",
      "translationZh": "速度与成本。与 Opus 5 相比，它的速度约快 30%，每项任务的成本约低 40%（@ClaudeDevs，@lydiahallie）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e6153f781af6bba",
      "translationZh": "沟通方面的改进。该模型将最重要的信息放在最前面，并遵循用户的写作规则。这针对的是用户对 Opus 5 最常提出的反馈（@claudeai）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "68422488c6f0cafa",
      "translationZh": "5 小时会话的使用限额提高了 20%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "45292655ee8fbbf6",
      "translationZh": "更低的定价意味着相同限额能多用 25%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2397bfbe252436d",
      "translationZh": "Pro、Max 和 Team 用户可获得一次留存备用的速率限制重置机会，可在自己选择的任意时间使用（@claudeai，@ClaudeDevs，@trq212）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f7dc2508a9a42bb7",
      "translationZh": "新的默认设置。Opus 5.5 现已成为 Claude Code 和 Claude 应用（包括 Cowork）中的默认模型。默认推理力度为 medium（中等），被描述为“智能水平与 Fable 5.1 相当，但速度更快”（@_catwu）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d6dfa1a86c762af9",
      "translationZh": "可用性。它已在 Claude Code 和 Claude Platform API 中上线（@ClaudeDevs），也已在 Claude Tag for Slack 中上线（@_catwu）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b9f6445bfbb45e03",
      "translationZh": "路线图。Sonnet 5.5 和 Haiku 5.5 将于“未来几周内”陆续推出（@mikeyk，@AiBattle_）。这与 Haiku 已被停用的传闻相矛盾（@kimmonismus）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab295c0b59f3cc33",
      "translationZh": "安全防护。Opus 5.5 是首个在网络安全、生物安全和前沿 LLM 开发方面具备 Fable 5.1 级别安全防护措施的 Opus 模型。被标记的请求会回退至另一个模型处理，Anthropic 表示正在“努力减少错误标记”（@ClaudeDevs）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59800fb8e4cc9b92",
      "translationZh": "发布前的迹象。在公告发布前不久，有人在 Claude Code 中发现了该模型（@kimmonismus）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf3c44a2cb445e57",
      "translationZh": "系统卡。系统卡已在发布时公布（@scaling01）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "578ab4b0aead8d69",
      "translationZh": "定价与 token 经济性（事实）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "efd0401941a5d16f",
      "translationZh": "标价。Token 定价下调了 20%，每 1M 输入/输出 token 的价格从 5/25 降至 4/20（@ValsAI）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "640ce0f9ff29d405",
      "translationZh": "更高的 token 用量抵消了部分降价收益。Vals 指出，Opus 5.5 往往会使用更多 token，尤其是在性能提升最大的编程任务上。更低的标价被用量增加部分抵消。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3dc6ba41a6217752",
      "translationZh": "Artificial Analysis 成本拆解。在最高推理强度下，Opus 5.5 每项 Intelligence Index 任务的成本为 5.98，而 Opus 5（最高推理强度）为 5.86。他们的拆解如下（ @ArtificialAnlys ）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa7eda88f701da39",
      "translationZh": "仅 token 用量增加这一项，就会使每项任务的成本上升约 80%，达到 10.51。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b7ebbb13d4478e0",
      "translationZh": "基础价格下调 20% 后，成本降至 8.41。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "266491dcf2b9ce5a",
      "translationZh": "更便宜的缓存读取（0.20）使成本降至 5.98。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c52cfc48f6f90d8d",
      "translationZh": "这意味着什么。在最高推理强度下，相比 Opus 5 的每项任务成本节省不复存在。“便宜 40%”的说法适用于默认（中等）设置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ea0b40a040059a0",
      "translationZh": "与 Fable 5.1 相比。Cline 报告称，Opus 5.5 在 Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index 上的表现优于 Fable 5.1，成本约为后者的 1/2.5（ @cline ）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6461c64a11a9fb42",
      "translationZh": "提示词缓存。在 Claude Code v2.1.280+ 中，会话中途切换推理强度不会破坏提示词缓存（ @lydiahallie ）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9cdd185e78cc0c71",
      "translationZh": "模型规模（推测）。@theo 声称 Opus 5.5 比 Opus 5 更小，并将其归功于后训练。官方帖子并未证实这一说法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "40416b2108f61ba8",
      "translationZh": "基准测试与独立评估",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "68eb9dd3123ad67e",
      "translationZh": "Anthropic 自己的表格。在 Anthropic 的主要对比表中，Opus 5.5 在每一项上都胜过 Fable 5.1，并在大多数项目上胜过 GPT‑6 Astra（@kimmonismus、@synthwavedd、@scaling01）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "500aeb4cca219e90",
      "translationZh": "@ShayneRedford（Anthropic）概括了所宣称的提升：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "47bbea62a1ae013b",
      "translationZh": "在 CursorBench、KWBench 和 OSWorld 上比 Astra 更强。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b788156b1caf3980",
      "translationZh": "风格和指令遵循能力好得多。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb49268304aeaba6",
      "translationZh": "科学与健康领域的能力更强。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9091f93f516e0481",
      "translationZh": "在抵御网络和生物领域的滥用方面更加稳健。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bcf8d93434b7480f",
      "translationZh": "第三方及合作伙伴评测：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c488b63be02b8660",
      "translationZh": "评测、结果与来源：Vals Index#1，相比 Opus 5 上升 2 个名次 / 2 分；Anthropic 占据前三名（GPT‑6 Sol 的结果待公布）@ValsAI。Vals RSI Index#1；首个在其评测规程下，在 LM Training 上超越已公布参考结果的模型；击败 Fable 5.1 @ValsAI，@ValsAI。FrontierSWE (Proximal)62.3%，排名 #2，仅次于 GPT‑6 Astra（65.5%）；领先于 Fable 5.1（56.3%）和 Opus 5（52.0%）@ProximalHQ。FrontierCode 1.1 (Cognition)在 Extended 上达到 65.3%；“以一小部分成本”从 Fable 5 手中夺得 #1 @cognition。CursorBench57.8%（Max），成为新的榜首模型；每项任务的成本比 Opus 5 低 40% @cursor_ai。Perplexity WANDR0.610，每项任务成本为 4.13；成绩略高于 Fable 5.1，成本却低 67.6% @perplexity_ai。ParseBench（表格）93.9%，比 Opus 5 高 7 分；击败 Fable、Gemini、Astra @jerryjliu0。Roboflow 视觉/检测：“迄今为止 Anthropic 最好的视觉模型”；如今已跻身 Playground 排行榜上领先于 Google 的模型之列 @skalskip92，@skalskip92",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c3efd85f48e297c",
      "translationZh": "评测细节与注意事项：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "be2774d86f1feedb",
      "translationZh": "Vals 运行设置。RSI 在原生 Claude Code 中以 max effort 运行，上下文为 1M，最大输出 token 数为 128K，温度为 1（@ValsAI）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "13fed9c4f77e2683",
      "translationZh": "ParseBench 的注意事项。该模型在图表、格式和版面布局方面仍表现吃力。每页成本为 5.8¢，LlamaIndex 认为它用于生产环境 OCR 太贵。这一判断来自一家拥有竞争产品的供应商。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "48b176490dd9fd47",
      "translationZh": "AI 研发与编程。@eliebakouch 对系统卡的解读是：“AI 研发方面大致相当，但在智能体编程方面强得惊人。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "03ff61701622857a",
      "translationZh": "饱和。@scaling01 问 CoBench 是否已经“废了”。@synthwavedd 则开玩笑说，有个新基准刚推出就已经饱和了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "335119ebbb52d937",
      "translationZh": "Arena。Opus 5.5 已进入 Agent Arena，并已加入 WebDev、Text、Vision 和 Document 的 Battle Mode。目前还没有分数（@arena）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "164f1abff125d242",
      "translationZh": "推理投入扩展异常。在一张智能体编程图表中，xhigh 推理投入的成本约为 medium 的 2.8 倍，得分却低了 3.2 分（@LearnOpenCV）。@Yuchenj_UW 称其为“最离奇的基准测试结果”，并建议继续使用 medium。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6f3f8b43b32ead7",
      "translationZh": "@nrehiew_ 给出了一个解释：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d2cd619f404af26b",
      "translationZh": "Opus 5 在 FrontierCode 上也呈现出同样的模式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f55a1ae1c09cfac",
      "translationZh": "FrontierCode 会对不必要的改动扣分，而更高的推理投入会导致范围蔓延。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "069f0fe8a955a491",
      "translationZh": "因此，模型“在更高的推理投入下，表现始终更差”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bbc7f757144d24e5",
      "translationZh": "多智能体扩展。系统卡在第 8.12 节报告了扩展至 100 个并行智能体的情况。@scaling01 称这是首份此类实验室报告。@maksym_andr 强调，这是关于多智能体扩展定律的证据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "848030f72cbf594a",
      "translationZh": "ProgramBench 的注意事项。ProgramBench 作者 @OfirPress 指出，Anthropic 接近 100% 的解决率来自一个 166/200 的子集。该子集很可能排除了最难的程序，例如 FFmpeg 和 PHP 编译器。他还指出了一个指标不匹配的问题（@OfirPress，@OfirPress）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8fcd9efeee589698",
      "translationZh": "Anthropic 报告的是平均测试通过率。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12279c05fd026c82",
      "translationZh": "ProgramBench 报告的是任务的完整完成情况。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c9f593772a7b452",
      "translationZh": "部分解决的结果往往能通过 60–70% 的测试，这会抬高通过率指标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ed720a824d8f4d6",
      "translationZh": "与 Mythos 5.1 的比较。Opus 5.5 在 Anthropic 的 ECI 上得分高于 Mythos 5.1，并且在每一项接受测试的网络安全评估中都胜过它（@scaling01，@scaling01）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e0ddaae0afc490cb",
      "translationZh": "奇怪的失对齐发现。@teortaxesTex 引用了一段话：恶意输出“几乎只出现在这样的情形中：在恶意输出之前，Claude 犯了一个不大可能发生、但无害的错误”。他问 Anthropic 是否“把自己变成了潜伏特工”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33f2248c8a0a0218",
      "translationZh": "“由 RSI 训练而来。”他另外引用了一句关于“首个由 RSI 训练而来的模型”的话，并称这令人担忧（@teortaxesTex）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "99ee72ef849637e1",
      "translationZh": "生物医学成像。@iScienceLuvr 对所报告的生物医学图像分析能力表示欢迎。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59631578bf556a3a",
      "translationZh": "希望获得更多信息。@scaling01 要求提供不使用思维链时的时间跨度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "70d54bc8fbc809a2",
      "translationZh": "安全立场与防护措施争议",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a50faf606e311d84",
      "translationZh": "Sam Bowman：Opus 5.5“比其前代产品安全得多，因此发布它更有可能降低、而非增加与失对齐相关的风险”，尤其是最极端的对齐风险（@sleepinyourhat，@sleepinyourhat）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0442e10f1b39fad9",
      "translationZh": "他也承认，自己担心能否跟上不断升级的风险，同时表示，在这一能力水平上，现有工具仍然值得信赖（@sleepinyourhat）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf9ef692f7fd1aa8",
      "translationZh": "Mike Krieger 提到了广泛的对齐测试和外部评估，包括 METR 开展的评估（@mikeyk）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f940fd07bf99252",
      "translationZh": "过度触发回退。@iScienceLuvr 在要求 Opus 5.5 治愈癌症后，被降级到了回退模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "873292fea9f65ec3",
      "translationZh": "针对中国（单次测试）。@xlr8harder 表示，一次快速测试表明，前沿大语言模型开发分类器会针对中国硬件。他呼吁开展更多探测。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "595ec4f8f948a07f",
      "translationZh": "对涉及中国这一角度的反应。@teortaxesTex 将此描述为 Anthropic 在削弱中国 AI。@jakehalloran1 则将其解读为保护 Trainium 的技术诀窍。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "93f74078c5673e3d",
      "translationZh": "“控制前沿推进节奏”的叙事框架：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2197e8651e690d4f",
      "translationZh": "@theo 认为，今天发布的产品没有一个达到 Astra 或 Fable 级别，而这是有意控制推进节奏。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
